#Part 1
1.Open the sleep dataset in R 
```{r}
data(sleep)
View(sleep)
```

2. Is it long or wide format? How do you know? 
```{r}
sleep data set is in long format, we know this because theres multiple rows per ppt
```

3. Transform this data so that it is in the other format. 
```{r}
sleepWide <- sleep |> pivot_wider(id_cols="ID",names_from = "group", values_from = "extra",names_prefix ="group")

view(sleepWide)
```

4. Transform your data back to its original format. 
```{r}
sleepLong<-sleepWide |> pivot_longer(cols = c(group1, group2), names_to = "group", values_to = "extra")
```


